# Model
Model aims to predict the LKA based on the current RLD distance.

## Data
This experiment on generated data.
[generated_dataset](generated_dataset)

The jupyter notebook used to generate the dataset is [script](generated_dataset/generate dataset.ipynb)

## Archticture
Read the [paper](Putting Safety of Intended Functionality SOTIF into Practice.pdf) Proposed Model section.

### Loss
There are two types of operation for two modelling options:  
1. Enhancd mode  
	Mean square Error Loss for:  
		1. Reconstruction between original right lane distance RLD and the reconstructed tensor.
		1. Prediction  Loss between predicted and original LKA.    
2. Non Enhanced model:  
	Binary Cross Entropy 
		1. Prediction  Loss between predicted and original LKA.
